---
title: "Baton — UML Sequence: Webhook → Workflow Pipeline"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as 🏗️ External Platform<br/>(Procore/Xero/...)
    participant Webhook as ⚡ Webhook Route<br/>/api/webhooks/{platform}
    participant Connector as 🔌 PlatformConnector<br/>verifySignature()
    participant DynamoDB as 🗄️ DynamoDB
    participant SQS_WH as 📨 SQS<br/>webhook-processing
    participant Worker as ⚙️ WebhookWorker
    participant RuleEngine as 🎯 RuleEngine
    participant SQS_WF as 📨 SQS<br/>workflow-launcher
    participant Launcher as 🚀 LauncherWorker
    participant Maestro as 📝 Docusign Workflow Builder
    participant SQS_N as 📨 SQS<br/>notification-sender
    participant Notifier as 📧 NotifSender

    Note over Platform,Notifier: Event-Driven Pipeline (13 steps)

    Platform->>+Webhook: POST /api/webhooks/procore<br/>{event_type, resource_id, ...}
    Webhook->>+Connector: verifyWebhookSignature(body, headers, secret)
    Connector-->>-Webhook: {valid: true}

    Webhook->>DynamoDB: Store raw event<br/>→ webhook-events table
    Webhook->>SQS_WH: Enqueue {platform, eventId, payload}
    Webhook-->>-Platform: 200 OK

    Note over SQS_WH,Worker: Async Processing

    SQS_WH->>+Worker: Poll message
    Worker->>+Connector: extractEventInfo(payload)
    Connector-->>-Worker: {eventType: "vendor.created",<br/>summary, recordId, metadata}

    Worker->>DynamoDB: Create pipeline entry<br/>→ trigger-pipeline table<br/>status: "processing"

    Worker->>+RuleEngine: findMatchingRules(orgId, platform, eventType)
    RuleEngine->>DynamoDB: Query automation-rules<br/>GSI: orgId + status=active
    DynamoDB-->>RuleEngine: Matching rules[]
    RuleEngine->>RuleEngine: evaluateConditions(rule, eventData)
    RuleEngine-->>-Worker: matchedRules[]

    loop For each matched rule
        Worker->>Worker: mapFields(rule.actionConfig, eventData)
        Worker->>SQS_WF: Enqueue {ruleId, workflowId,<br/>triggerInputs, pipelineId}
        Worker->>DynamoDB: Update pipeline<br/>status: "matched"
    end
    Worker-->>-SQS_WH: Delete message (ack)

    SQS_WF->>+Launcher: Poll message
    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Get workflow details<br/>+ connection tokens
    Launcher->>Launcher: Decrypt access token<br/>(AES-256-GCM)

    Launcher->>+Maestro: POST /maestro/v1/workflows/{id}/instances<br/>{instanceName, triggerInputs}
    Maestro-->>-Launcher: {instanceId, status: "running"}

    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Store instance<br/>→ workflow-instances table
    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Update pipeline<br/>status: "completed"
    Launcher->>DynamoDB: Increment rule.timesTriggered
    Launcher->>SQS_N: Enqueue notification<br/>{type: "workflow_launched", ...}
    Launcher-->>-SQS_WF: Delete message (ack)

    SQS_N->>+Notifier: Poll message
    Notifier->>DynamoDB: Store in-app notification
    Notifier->>Notifier: Send email (Resend)<br/>and/or Slack message
    Notifier-->>-SQS_N: Delete message (ack)
